{"id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","title":"Satisfaction Relation","display":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-satisfaction","aliases":["58-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction Relation","depends_on":["[[58-df-structure]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\in V\\)</span>（各元数的常量、函数和关系符号集）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[\\,\\cdot\\mapsto\\cdot\\,]\">\\(s[\\,\\cdot\\mapsto\\cdot\\,]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\in V\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\in V\\)</span>（由结构给出的解释映射）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\coloneqq0\">\\(\\bot\\coloneqq0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\coloneqq1\">\\(\\top\\coloneqq1\\)</span>；在集合函数的值域中二者是不同的真值编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Val}(\\langle t,s\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Val}(\\langle t,s\\rangle)\\)</span>；右侧是一元的函数图应用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\;:\\!\\!\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle,\\top\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\;:\\!\\!\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle,\\top\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}\\)</span>；二元写法是与真值函数图对应的关系缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元解释函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\coloneqq g(\\{\\langle i,a_{i+1}\\rangle:i\\in n\\})\">\\(g(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\coloneqq g(\\{\\langle i,a_{i+1}\\rangle:i\\in n\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in A^n\">\\((t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in A^n\\)</span> 表示参数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle i,t_{i+1}\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in A^n\">\\(\\{\\langle i,t_{i+1}\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in A^n\\)</span>。此处圆括号元组的此项约定不改变函数图使用的 Kuratowski 有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\times\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\},\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat},\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\times\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\},\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(x,s)=s(x))\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(c,s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(f)(\\operatorname{Val}(t_1,s),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Val}(t_n,s))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(t_1\\doteq t_2,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Val}(t_1,s)=\\operatorname{Val}(t_2,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s)\\leftrightarrow\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{Val}(t_{i+1},s)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\neg\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s)\\leftrightarrow(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\lor\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\times\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\},\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat},\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\times\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\},\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(x,s)=s(x))\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(c,s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(f)(\\operatorname{Val}(t_1,s),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Val}(t_n,s))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(t_1\\doteq t_2,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Val}(t_1,s)=\\operatorname{Val}(t_2,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s)\\leftrightarrow\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{Val}(t_{i+1},s)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\neg\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s)\\leftrightarrow(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\lor\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}notation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}notation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\;(\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\;(\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}\\)</span> 是真值函数图取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的关系，而不是将集合函数当作逻辑真值。其展开式和元组应用约定均在 Hypothesis 中给出。</li>\n<li>不带语言的满足关系是显式存在量化语言的接口；固定语言时使用下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>递归覆盖原语法中的所有项和公式构造子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 12 (Model Theory background)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[