is]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $s[\\,\\cdot\\mapsto\\cdot\\,]$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\in V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s[\\,\\cdot\\mapsto\\cdot\\,]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\coloneqq0","display":false},{"tex":"\\top\\coloneqq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Val}(\\langle t,s\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\;:\\!\\!\\leftrightarrow\\;\\langle\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle,\\top\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"g(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\coloneqq g(\\{\\langle i,a_{i+1}\\rangle:i\\in n\\})","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in A^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle i,t_{i+1}\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in A^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\times\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\},\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat},\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\times\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\},\\{\\bot,\\top\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(x,s)=s(x))\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(c,s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Val}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n}(f)(\\operatorname{Val}(t_1,s),\\ldots,\\operatorname{Val}(t_n,s))\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl[\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(t_1\\doteq t_2,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Val}(t_1,s)=\\operatorname{Val}(t_2,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),s)\\leftrightarrow\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{Val}(t_{i+1},s)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\neg\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi\\lor\\psi,s)\\leftrightarrow(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\lor\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}(\\forall x\\,\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}notation}\\vdash \\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\bigl(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\;(\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L):\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false}],"bytes":5889,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a63c990f1580982","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S$ (selected valuation and satisfaction recursion, see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]])"},{"id":"2ff9f25cca69b423","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S$ (selected valuation and satisfaction recursion; see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]])"},{"id":"38339d60720b0f2a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"49ab3d1e37562023","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b163842f6e1db06","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"36b4649dd248921c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M_N,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)$（see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]）"},{"id":"2106ba11326cfe10","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})$ 且 $\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s_0)$（see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]] and [[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]）"},{"id":"bc25ac23108f07e8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8cddb830164d6d0b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S$ (selected recursive satisfaction data, see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]])"},{"id":"e721d6de164f106d","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on",